  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_typ\": \"CEFR Englis_Placement_Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nIn the bustling city of New York, where skyscrapers tower above and traffic never seems to stop, a small independent bookstore called 'The Quill' has managed to thrive. Founded by two friends who dreamed of creating a space for literature enthusiasts, The Quill quickly became more than just a shop; it was a community hub where readers could gather, discuss books, and even host author meet-and-greets.\\\\\nThe store's interior is warm yet elegant, with shelves filled to the brim with a wide variety of titles ranging from classic novels to contemporary bestsellers and everything in between. The Quill also offers curated book club sessions, where patrons can explore themes like 'The Power of Love' or 'Historical Fiction.'\\\\\nWhile many big-box chains have tried to enter the market with their low prices and mass selections, The Quill has managed to retain its niche by focusing on quality rather than quantity. Its staff is known for being passionate about books and always ready to recommend a great read or share their own favorites.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main purpose of The Quill?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"Selling books at low prices.\",\\\n        \"Hosting author meet-and-greets only.\",\\\n        \"Creating a community hub for literature enthusiasts.\",\\\n        \"Promoting the latest bestsellers exclusively.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"Creating a community hub for literature enthusiasts.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\\\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true about The Quill's selection?\\\\\"\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"It only carries classic novels.\",\\\n        \"It has a wide variety of titles, including contemporary bestsellers.\",\\\n        \"It focuses on selling the latest books only.\",\\\n        \"It primarily sells fiction works.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"It has a wide variety of titles, including contemporary bestsellers.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\\\n      \"question\": \"What activities are provided by The Quill for its patrons?\\\\\"\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"Only book signings.\",\\\n        \"Book club sessions and author meet-and-greets.\",\\\n        \"Attending lectures on literary history only.\",\\\n        \"Participating in quizzes about book plots.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"Book club sessions and author meet-and-greets.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\\\n      \"question\": \"Why has The Quill managed to retain its niche in the competitive book market?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"It offers lower prices than other stores.\",\\\n        \"It focuses on quality over quantity and has a passionate staff.\",\\\n        \"It exclusively carries classic novels.\",\\\n        \"It hosts more author meet-and-greets than any other store.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"It focuses on quality over quantity and has a passionate staff.\"\\\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\\\n      \"question\": \"What can be inferred about the author's attitude towards The Quill?\",\\\n      \"options\": [\\\n        \"They have no opinion.\",\\\n        \"They think it's a mediocre bookstore.\",\\\n        \"They appreciate its community-focused nature and quality selection.\",\\\n        \"They dislike the store because of its small size.\"\\\n      ],\\\n      \"answer\": \"They appreciate its community-focused nature and quality selection.\"\\\n    }\n  ]\n}",
